          </p>

          <p>
            In context, Blessed is mid-priced for a flavored plant protein but expensive next to plain pea isolates. Unflavored Naked Pea is about a third of the price per gram, and NOW Sports Pea is under half. You are paying Blessed's premium for the flavor system: the creamer, the stevia blend and dessert flavors that buyers mostly like. If you blend your shakes with fruit or bake with protein, that premium buys you very little. Our <a href="/best-cheap-protein-powder/">cheap protein powder guide</a> ranks more options by the same math.
          </p>
